{{Term/Store|Squirrel|Squirrels|Series, TotK}} are recurring [[Animal]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|Series, TotK}}<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= E |publisher= |page= 63 {{Exp Game|Series}}}}</ref><ref name="TotK Dantz"/>{{Name Ref|BotW, OoA (Himekawa)}}

==Characteristics==
==={{ALttP|-}}===
In {{ALttP}}, Squirrels appear frolicking near the [[Pedestal of Time]] in the [[Lost Woods]]. In {{ALttP&FS}}, [[Link]] must catch a Squirrel as a part of the [[Lumberjack's Riddles]].<ref>{{Cite|It munches on nuts...|Q. Bumpkin|ALttP&FS}}</ref>

==={{TP|-}}===
In {{TP}}, Squirrels appear in the [[Ordona Province]]. Once Link returns to [[Ordon Village]] in his [[Wolf Link|Wolf form]], one Squirrel tells him to talk with other animals to gather information.<ref>{{Cite|If you run into any trouble, try talking to the animals in town. We animals understand one another, so you'll be fine!|Squirrel|TP}}</ref>

==={{ALBW|-}}===
In {{ALBW}}, Squirrels reside in the Lost Woods, near the Pedestal of Time. They run away when Link moves close to them. In the ending, Squirrels are seen gathering around [[Gulley]] in the [[Haunted Grove]].

==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Main|Bushy-Tailed Squirrel}}
In {{BotW}}, [[Bushy-Tailed Squirrel]]s can be found in wooded areas. They can be hunted down by using the [[Bow]]. When defeated, they drop a single [[Acorn]].<ref>{{Cite|They tend to live in forests and subsist on acorns and other nuts.|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref>

