==Other Appearances==
==={{OoA|-}} (Himekawa)===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
In the {{OoA (Himekawa)}}, Link and [[Impa]] enter a forest in search of the Oracle of Ages, [[Nayru]]. They are stopped by the forest animals, including a Squirrel, that them to go back.<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= Go back. Go back. Go back.|book= {{OoA (Himekawa)|-}}|publisher= VIZ Media|page= 22}}</ref> The animals let the two pass after realizing Link is a [[Hylian]] of the old blood.<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= His ears are pointed. He's a Hylian. A Hylian of the old blood!|book= {{OoA (Himekawa)|-}}|publisher= VIZ Media|page= 23}}</ref> A Squirrel listens to Nayru sing and as she speaks with Impa and Link. When it is learned that Impa is possessed by [[Veran]], the Squirrel and other animals charge her. The charge does nothing against Veran and she possesses the oracle. After Veran uses Nayru to travel to Labrynna's past, the Squirrel watches as Link picks up the [[Harp of Ages]] and talks to [[Ralph]].
{{Noncanon|End}}

